9
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:25,120
Great.

10
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,240
Let's go and see them.

11
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:28,860
Oh, look.

12
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,100
A baby wolf and its mother.

13
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,960
Do you like wolves, Emma?

14
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,000
No, I don't.

15
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,500
