18
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:44,600
Look.

19
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:47,040
The monkeys are over there.

20
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,160
Wow.

21
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,000
Aren't their faces interesting?

22
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:51,620
Yes.

23
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,600
They look like us.
